{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28242","headline":"闻明上人逝寄友人 · 李远","name":"闻明上人逝寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧寺曾过最上方，碧桐浓叶覆西廊。\n游人缥缈红衣乱，座客从容白日长。\n别後旋成庄叟梦，书来忽报惠休亡。\n他时若更相随去，祗是含酸对影堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}